(B) Much less than $0.8 \times 10^{6} \mathrm{eV}$.
(C) Nearly $0.8 \times 10^{6} \mathrm{eV}$.
(D) Much larger than $0.8 \times 10^{6} \mathrm{eV}$.
\end{itemize}

\section*{ANSWER : C}
